## Not scoped here

- Repairing any downstream consumer that imports the bare specifier `hal-engine`. That is the consuming project's work; type-only and value imports break together, because a module specifier resolves at compile time either way.
- Carrying a session id on the WebSocket upgrade request, which is what would let a REST-created chat id reach a socket. T014 documents the gap instead.
